{"id":"n92525-1-8","stage":2,"title":"돌려받다 · 收回","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n92525-1-8-1","ko":"민준이에게 빌려준 책은 돌려받았니?","zh":"借给敏俊的书拿回来了吗？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"민준이에게","meaning":"敏俊","explanation":"민준：敏俊；이：名词后缀，构成派生名词；에게：格助词，表示动作所涉及的人：“给、对、向”等。","readings":[{"term":"민준이에게","audio":"/audio/e888314c3be8314425d2.mp3"}],"sources":[],"surfaceReading":{"term":"민준이에게","audio":"/audio/e888314c3be8314425d2.mp3"}},{"text":"빌려준","meaning":"借；给予，给","explanation":"빌리다：借；주다：给予，给；어：连接后续动作或辅助表达；常与前面的词干缩合；ㄴ：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"빌리다","audio":"/audio/7cc8358d972a7f6932ef.mp3"},{"term":"주다","audio":"/audio/1b43f195318e9604abd7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17824","senseId":"1","lemma":"빌리다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"},{"entryId":"82136","senseId":"1","lemma":"주다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"빌려준","audio":"/audio/7fc122a002d29a199042.mp3"}},{"text":"책은","meaning":"书，书籍，画册","explanation":"책：书，书籍，画册；은：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"책","audio":"/audio/ba928dd573a2db9e7579.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71468","senseId":"1","lemma":"책","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"책은","audio":"/audio/8966259a81fab6fe0e30.mp3"}},{"text":"돌려받았니?","meaning":"收回，拿回","explanation":"돌려받다：收回，拿回；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合；니：非敬语疑问句末，用于亲近的人、晚辈或自问。","readings":[{"term":"돌려받다","audio":"/audio/9e94b84733ecbc9e2a2a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"92525","senseId":"1","lemma":"돌려받다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"돌려받았니","audio":"/audio/b2779fa5f34ac2ca8be2.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"7cc8358d972a7f69","term":"빌리다","zh":"借","audio":"/audio/7cc8358d972a7f6932ef.mp3","entryId":"17824","definition":"一定时间内使用别人的东西或钱等，并约定事后还回或支付代价。","pronunciation":["빌리다"]},{"id":"1b43f195318e9604","term":"주다","zh":"给予，给","audio":"/audio/1b43f195318e9604abd7.mp3","entryId":"82136","definition":"把东西等递给别人，让别人拥有或使用。","pronunciation":["주다"]},{"id":"ba928dd573a2db9e","term":"책","zh":"书，书籍，画册","audio":"/audio/ba928dd573a2db9e7579.mp3","entryId":"71468","definition":"把文章或画印刷之后装订成册而成的物品。","pronunciation":["책"]},{"id":"9e94b84733ecbc9e","term":"돌려받다","zh":"收回，拿回","audio":"/audio/9e94b84733ecbc9e2a2a.mp3","entryId":"92525","definition":"重新找回借出或被夺走的东西。","pronunciation":["돌려받따"]}],"audio":"/audio/b969cdf9835675d219be.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n92525-1-8-2","ko":"응. 어제 주더라.","zh":"嗯，他昨天还给我了。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"응.","meaning":"是，行","explanation":"응：是，行。","readings":[{"term":"응","audio":"/audio/107dd01c3d38a368ad44.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"30205","senseId":"2","lemma":"응","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"응","audio":"/audio/107dd01c3d38a368ad44.mp3"}},{"text":"어제","meaning":"昨天，昨日","explanation":"어제：昨天，昨日。","readings":[{"term":"어제","audio":"/audio/79c5ada11647bce64407.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67075","senseId":"1","lemma":"어제","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"어제","audio":"/audio/79c5ada11647bce64407.mp3"}},{"text":"주더라.","meaning":"给予，给","explanation":"주다：给予，给；더라：回顾并告诉对方亲身观察到的情况，非敬语。","readings":[{"term":"주다","audio":"/audio/1b43f195318e9604abd7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"82136","senseId":"1","lemma":"주다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"주더라","audio":"/audio/608611b6764fbc82fffb.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"107dd01c3d38a368","term":"응","zh":"是，行","audio":"/audio/107dd01c3d38a368ad44.mp3","entryId":"30205","definition":"用于肯定回答对方所提出的问题或命令等。","pronunciation":["응"]},{"id":"79c5ada11647bce6","term":"어제","zh":"昨天，昨日","audio":"/audio/79c5ada11647bce64407.mp3","entryId":"67075","definition":"今天的前一天。","pronunciation":["어제"]},{"id":"1b43f195318e9604","term":"주다","zh":"给予，给","audio":"/audio/1b43f195318e9604abd7.mp3","entryId":"82136","definition":"把东西等递给别人，让别人拥有或使用。","pronunciation":["주다"]}],"audio":"/audio/db5a7a50ea51d963c5ad.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficult